Subject: [PATCH] isolate embedded Python and repair loader lifecycle
Upstream-Defect: The 4.7-alpha21 loader initializes CPython from ambient process state, cannot resolve the exported desktop runtime layout, schedules an invalid editor icon update during language registration, and leaves script and resource-loader references alive at shutdown.
Deletion-Condition: Remove this patch when an exact upstream artifact uses isolated PyConfig, supports self-contained desktop exports, excludes ambient and working-directory imports, and passes Mornlea editor and lifecycle qualification.

